Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.33,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.33,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marathize.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.30,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.75,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That towers. Wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the next day. I'm\Ngoing to go back to the next day.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the battle of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a plan involving Russian snack foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora keeps talking about this Yuri kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I be jealous?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,0)\fscx110\fscy110\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(320,326)}The Attack of Demon's Army
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never fear, Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have brought\Nhome a Russian souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a bowl of borscht\Nand a hot peruski.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way should we turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I do miss all the friends we made.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll catch some dinner at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about... What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know something really\Nbad's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arukeniman's way too evil to just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'm due.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctors say that on average, the youth\Nof today are overworked and underpaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you gotta admit,\NI'm way above average.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys watch\Nthe news on television?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, and sometimes we wish you were on\NTV so we could press the mute button.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I could be a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I call humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's so funny, I\Ndeserve my own TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to head home. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always forget that Ken lives\Non the other side of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken sure has turned\Nthings around for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was out for so long, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really meant to give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been watching special\NTV news reports saying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monsters were on the\Nloose all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are the monsters there all\Ntalking about the Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you have something\Nto do with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gotta admit I'm involved\Nin what's been happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't have to worry, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there is one other thing that\Nhappened that still has me concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was out eating lunch when I\Nmet this very strange fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spoke about odd things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said to me what happened three\Nyears ago isn't finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know you may not believe this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this was the same exact\Nguy who three years ago was
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,asking me all about the\NHighton View Terrace incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got the feeling from\Nwhat he said that he has
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something to do with all\Nthe stuff that's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this man you met, was he a human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean a human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course he was a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it could\Nhave been Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or could it? Hey, Mom. What's\Nfor dinner? Doofus! You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where were you, Saturn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for me to know, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those goggles are numbing your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now a follow-up to the\Nspecial report broadcast earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reports indicate that\Nat approximately 4 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,local time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the monsters that suddenly\Nappeared all over the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world just as suddenly\Ndisappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Details are still unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he\Npicked her instead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just hanging out\Nwith a few of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad your home's safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're a responsible young man, but\Nnext time call me if you're running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made some tuna casserole for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get you some?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds great, but I'm too\Npreoccupied to eat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I take the\Nelevator like everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look angry. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arukenimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why my dad died, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father was a respected policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was on special assignment\Nguarding a government official.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone tried to shoot this\Nofficial, and your father saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he died in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason I ask you is because\Nlately I've been thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how Dad sacrificed his own life\Nso someone else could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing like home cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, now that you're finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go down to the store and\Ntell Dad to come eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, sis, it's time for dinner. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so peaceful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe\Nwhat happened earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do any of the new kids know\Nwhat you're up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have broken some dark\Nrings, a couple of dark spirals,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your group has got to be prepared\Nfor what you know is coming next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we've destroyed\NControl Spire, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they look like real\NDigimon and fought like them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they weren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't have hearts, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agamon's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can these new guys make the\Ntough decisions we made?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just kids, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll have to fight real Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're gonna have to win or\Ninnocent people will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Kunemon and Mamemon are still\Non the prowl here in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your group has got to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world is counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's Saturday, so\NI'll let you sleep in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I really did see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jess, what was that shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, what were you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really not important, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that we both\Nbetter get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my antennae are drooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Ken, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you saw a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like a really bad nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you. Ask away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we travel together\Nabout two years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both went into the\NDigiWorld Desert, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember if I hurt my neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were hurting so much, and I had\Nno idea what was wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I have amnesia, and I\Ncan't even recall what happened then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right after I got hurt,\Nwhat happened next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, after that, I took care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took you three weeks to heal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then you left me and\Nreturned to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's all of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're just starting to remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my memories are fuzzy like\Nsomething's interrupting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something happened to me that day. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.89,0:08:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'd better report that\Nwe've pinpointed his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been an update\Nregarding the strange
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster disappearance around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, our lead story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beginning late yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,police have received reports that children\Nfrom all over the city are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Police say that scores of\Nchildren are currently missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Police fear foul play\Nand are investigating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are so many children missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their parents must be beside themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.59,0:09:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look awfully pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stood up quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like I knew this was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Marine Devimon, an ocean Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I use my dark deluge attack,\NI shoot out poisonous ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Matt and it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm LadyDevimon, a fallen angel Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My darkness wave attack changes my\Nopponent's power into exploding dark energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news, another monster's been\Nspotted over on the east side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a camera over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Skullcetemon, a ghost Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see power and my special nail bone attack\Nalways crushes whoever gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another one on the north side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could be in\Ntwo places at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarimon, reliable guardian of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.48,0:12:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve into champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dive in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, Digimon! Go team!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Masters!\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Masters, Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vulcan's hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, get him, Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK, stop that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, rescuing the passengers\Non that boat is more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you. Darkness Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, this is dangerous. Take cover now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon, I... Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better stay out of it if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stop me, you witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting boring. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, it looks like Davis is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, and Ken's with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did some dog chew on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're bouncing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's got excited molecules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weirdo is really different from\Nany other Digimon that we bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Different from any\Nother Digimon we fought?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you think that means this\Nguy isn't working with Arukenimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're sure making a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When can we make a scene\Ninstead of just sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could work out even\Nbetter than we had planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this means there's some other\Nevil creep besides Arukenimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sure possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is way too strong to\Nbe a control spy or Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's just too pure evil to\Nbe controlled by a dark ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's his story?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody has got to be behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is crunch time.\NTime's up. Take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hyeldrumon, it's time to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hyeldrumon, make a Digimon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\Ndo the power of the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Mega-Digimon? Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nail Bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be destroyed, you gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he looks, I'd say he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that Skullsatamon's\Nenergy has short
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-circuited Imperial Dramon's\Ndata freezing him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So can we defrost him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs time to reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take over from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's not like other Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you've got to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, we did digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I bet we still have\Nsome of Azulamon's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, can I get back to you on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where's that bag of\Nbones now? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need to catch a bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should just drop the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about really bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, crunch time and we get\Nturned back into rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.18,0:17:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta go save those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know the reason our\NDigimon turned back into rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've never been in the real\Nworld for this long a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't help us if they stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:18:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get them back to the\Ndigital world as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't hurry, there\Nwon't be a bus to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, crew, let's get going. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give all the energy we've\Ngot to Imperialdramon to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've seen enough of this statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, it's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperialdramon, go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Tremont, Imperial\NTremont, Mode Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tremont, Tremont, Tremont,\Nare the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperialdramon, Fighter Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in this mode he has the ability to walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two legs and his fighting\Npower is tripled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is definitely more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to write!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be cataclysmic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big deal, so he changed his costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,POSITRON LASER!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, he was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never easy, it's always tough to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.32,0:19:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a whole busload of kids riding on the\Noutcome, that was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, the time you were\Ntalking about has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did well, Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken Ichijoji, you must come with me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want with Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have something I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a dark spore\Nburied deep in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want all your friends to suffer\Ngreatly, you'd better come with me, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really think you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Ken, it's time for us to be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect me to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These little tykes are eager to\Nshare the ride with you, their hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you so heartless you\Ndon't care what happens to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kennapper, I knew you were behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was doing them a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they heard they were\Ngoing to meet Ken Ichijoji,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they came of their own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken! Don't, Ken. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly have a lot of nerve\Nto cross the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daemon, I'm not trying to cross anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a woman who's driven to take\Ncare of business, and that's no crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:20:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to teach you a serious lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aru Kunemon, you'll never\Nget away with this! Ken! Ken!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are always, always, never
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.17,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of them are always,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.17,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, whenever. We\Ncan move on a step further.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them always, always, never.\NWe are all at the same time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.18,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are all alone. We are all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shacko Mon and the Ma-ri-n-de-vi-mon\Nare very close to the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the secret of the M-A-N-O-T-E?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the secret of the M-A-N-O-T-E?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Adventure 02!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gate is open.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.56,0:23:03.48,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx100\fscy100\pos(321,319)}Deadly Battle With the Dark Digimon

